      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "It was investigated the influence of a diet supplemented with PUFA omega-3 (\"Eiconol\") on dynamic of basal and postprandial glycemia, blood pressure, lipid levels, parameters of lipid peroxidation in 60 patients with non-insulin-dependent diabetes mellitus. Fish oil (\"Eiconol\") was used as a dietary supplement of PUFA omega-3. The results of investigations indicated that a diet supplemented with \"Eiconol\" (8 g/day) increased the effect of dietary therapy in correction of essential hypertension and atherogenic lipids. It was not the worsening of the glycemia and activation of lipid peroxidation."},
